{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Mistah Noodles","id":"363458590461132800","is_bot":0,"username":"mistahnoodles"},"author_id":"363458590461132800","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"\"I was talking with the wolf and I provoked it. We *were* having a civil conversation, but... my tongue was a bit sharper than I intended...\"","created_at":"2021-08-24T11:06:21.226000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"879683043227496499","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"He shakes his head sadly. \"Had I made less mistakes in my youth, I would be able to bring you back without any issues or waiting.\" he sighs. \"But that kind of magic would inflict too harsh a a price now. And bad things done to you are never your fault. You are the kind of person who does not not do things worthy of being hurt, let alone being murdered...\"","created_at":"2021-08-24T11:08:45.958000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"879683650277486603","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
