{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Versil","id":"148682928434577408","is_bot":0,"username":"versil"},"author_id":"148682928434577408","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"Roy nods. \"The wolf did ambush us while we were having a picnic, that's what started this whole thing. You were only doing what you can to get out of that tough situation. I see no fault of yours here.\"","created_at":"2021-08-24T11:12:01.983000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"879684472465944617","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"'You showed it more mercy than I would have. And mercy's... sort of one of my tenets. You did nothing wrong here.'","created_at":"2021-08-24T11:14:40.132000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"879685135790931999","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Mistah Noodles","id":"363458590461132800","is_bot":0,"username":"mistahnoodles"},"author_id":"363458590461132800","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"\"Mister Demetrius...\" Eloise moves to hug the ancient fey but stops herself. \"Our youth is meant for making mistakes... some of them have consequences bigger then we know... I don't know what you did and I don't need to. If its too steep a price I won't have you paying it for me. You're *my* Patron, you shouldn't be trying to fix my mistakes. Besides... I've kinda been unworthy of your generosity... even less reason for you to pay my tab.\" Eloise let's out a weak laugh.","created_at":"2021-08-24T11:15:56.998000Z","edited_at":"2021-08-24T11:16:35.690000Z","id":"879685458190282763","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
