{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"'Feel free to take your time and think about it, if you need to. You're welcome to stay here.'","created_at":"2021-08-24T11:38:17.567000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"879691080944222268","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"He nods and smiles before giving one final bow. \"I will begin the process.\" He will carry Willow if she wishes to return to the cafe, and begin his return trip","created_at":"2021-08-24T11:39:06.857000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"879691287681466378","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
