{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"'Ah, I mean in spirit. But then, she can always come over once we have everything...' she turns to Eloise. 'Kukudh or I will stay here to keep you company whilst the other goes to help find what we need. Which of us would you prefer?'","created_at":"2021-08-24T11:43:21.155000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"879692354284552232","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
