{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"\"Well, I know what happened when I delivered the Speaker and Meorys before. Gaillardia went into a sort of trance. I believe that's when she talks to the spirits.\"","created_at":"2021-08-24T11:44:36.001000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"879692668211433562","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
